	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Puto te, praeceptor charissime, literas meas accepisse, quas ad medium <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>septembris d. <persName ref="p8466">Wolphgango</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8466">Wolfgang Wissenburg</persName>.</note> doctori theologo reliqui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ut tu primum, deinde <placeName ref="l339">Neocomenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>amici censuerunt, <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> 20. septembris cum libris ingressus sum, sed nil usquam minus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>commune cum libris<note type="margin">a.R.: literis?</note> quam illic repperi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ne quidem affectu <placeName ref="l512">Tubingam</placeName> rapior.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed tamen... <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>consulit mea prudentia (si qua est) hactenus cessit ac fors illi tuetur quod fere me <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>penituit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sed quidnam me ad prius consilium redire fecerit, brevi accipies.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nunquam consensi.<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>.. de <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName>, nisi spe illa, quam nobiles mihi amici aliqui <placeName ref="l691">Lotharingi</placeName> fecerant.<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>.. in se receperant, ut familam meam... addu <placeName ref="l491">Argentinae</placeName> mense septembri (ut tum i<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>llic adessem).</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Adfui nec... potuerunt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Conquestus sum <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensium</placeName> primoribus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et eram vix tres dies ingressus omnia...</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l512">Tubingam</placeName> misi consilium dedissent uti <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>principes <placeName ref="l822">Germaniae</placeName> adirem, presertim quorum advocatus fui.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Literas cum ad... haberem, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quae... sinerent me (cuius industria in publicis et privatis negociis uti vellent) <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>agere apud eos... <placeName ref="l822">Germanie</placeName> familiamque cum bonis eo venire, placuit cons... et <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>mox exequi voluit, duos bonos publicos equos cum equite mihi commodavit <placeName ref="l491">Argent<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>inensis</placeName> respublica... pie... et consilium successit per septembr... iter a<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>rripui, 18. novembris redii literas ab illustrissimo <persName ref="p1546">Christophoro</persName> duce <placeName ref="l572">Virtembergensi</placeName>, <persName ref="p18509">Augusto</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>duce <placeName ref="l749">Saxonie</placeName> electore, <persName>Vilhelmo</persName> landgravio iuniore <placeName ref="l213">Hassie</placeName>, Palatino electore, <persName ref="p2411">Henrico <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Otthone</persName> obtinui et ab <persName>Christophor</persName> <persName>Prob</persName> <persName>Vito</persName> et aliis... literas ad <persName>Ulricum</persName>..<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> ut legatione hac fungent ad regem <placeName ref="l832">Gallum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed quum nec domum... <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>nec locum librorum... <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> invenirem (obtenturus, si...) expectare voluissem.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Ego rursus et... morarum impatiens (alioquin enim saltem totam hyemem...) <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>gratiam professurus eram rebus... inclusis iter verti <placeName ref="l512">Tubingam</placeName> piissimus <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><persName ref="p8111">Petrus Martir</persName> et <persName>Hieronimus Sanctus</persName> vere doctus theologus<note type="margin">a.R.: <persName ref="p4037">Zanchi</persName></note>, <persName ref="p714">Coelii Curionis</persName> <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensi<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>s</placeName> gener me... sunt... ultima... hodie... hunc cum libris i<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ngressus sum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Negotia mea... sunt, nisi hac hieme familiam eruam vix unquam.<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>.. turus sum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Nuntius <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensis</placeName> non suffecit, quia... <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>princeps omnia... extorquebit et sic poterit familia mea proximo hic <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>adesse, et tum... omnes in papismum effundam.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Preterea principes <placeName ref="l822">Germanie</placeName> me..<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>. se debere... ad regem <placeName ref="l832">Gallum</placeName> scribunt.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Vix e manibus <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>landgravii proripui... quoque et duplicia offerentis me... <placeName ref="l210">He<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>idelberge</placeName> det<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>inere voluer<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>unt, sed... <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>vicit, quod princeps <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>optim<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>us <placeName ref="l572">Virtembe<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>rgensis</placeName> primu<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>s ad me <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>spectasset pr<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>imusqu<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>e manum mea<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>m <persName>Hal<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>lprune</persName> pre<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>hend<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>isset, a quo (... <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>primo tuo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>sancto et paterno <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>consilio) vocatus fui... non <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>potuerim illum spe sua <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>fraudare.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Itaque... fam<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ilia me... huc me factu<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>rum venire conqueror... prius et... <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>obtenta... reipublicae <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensis</placeName>..<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>. eoque sal<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>utato hac ad... de te mittendas misi.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>preceptor et pater charissime, prim<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>us es omnium, qui... <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>cum tuorum tot<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>o numero saluto.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l512">Tubinge</placeName> in ho<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>spitio Corone 28. novembris 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Amicos omnes... meo nomi<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>ne saluta... tantum non.<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>.. semper.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Obsequentis<lb xml:id="p2z20"/>simus tuus <persName ref="p974">Car<lb xml:id="p2z21"/>olus Molineus</persName> olim <placeName ref="l832">Galliae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>nunc <placeName ref="l822">Germanie</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>iureco<lb xml:id="p2z24"/>n<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>sultus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
